# were hand-authored from `reference/lsp-3.17/metaModel.json`, and §8.5 wants
# the first kind — "a field that appears in no captured message is untested by
# construction, and that is exactly the long tail". Nothing in
# `tests/differential.rs` knows which a line is, so growing the captured half
